  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-008 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah, and Urgot. Version 0.10.9 keeps Urgot W on the crash-safe single-hit pure-data route with no delayed scheduler, stale entity handle, or body-covering cannon effect; E retains the rush-behind flip contract. Shen Q now sends and recalls his spirit blade for three empowered attacks, while E dashes through enemy champions and applies a 1.5-second taunt recognized by the stock AI. The five legacy replacements use fixed battle-actor scale, and Sivir's real match scoreboard uses the corrected full-face crop. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
